01:20:52,941 --> 01:20:58,941
U Turn is a 1997 American neo-noir crime thriller film directed by Oliver Stone, and starring Sean Penn, Billy Bob
Thornton, Jennifer Lopez, Jon Voight, Powers Boothe, Joaquin Phoenix, Claire Danes and Nick Nolte.

12
01:28:14,117 --> 01:28:20,117
It is based on the book Stray Dogs by John
Ridley, who also wrote the screenplay.

13
01:35:35,294 --> 01:35:41,294
U Turn premiered at the Telluride Film Festival on August 27, 1997 before being
released by Sony Pictures Releasing on October 3, 1997 in the United States.

14
01:42:56,470 --> 01:43:02,470
The film grossed $6.6 million in the United States against an estimated $19
million budget, and received mixed reviews from critics.

15
01:50:17,647 --> 01:50:23,647
The film explores themes of small town, robbery,
gambling debt, arizona, wilderness.

